context3:[
 ['hesitate','Lena did not hesitate. She jumped into the pool right away.','pause before acting','act right away','swim fast'],['astonished','Max was astonished. He never expected to see snow in May.','very surprised','not interested','a little sleepy'],['conceal','Pat tried to conceal the gift under a blanket so no one would see it.','hide','show','wrap'],['abundant','Apples were abundant this fall. Every tree was heavy with fruit.','more than enough','hard to find','not yet ripe'],['cease','The rain will cease soon, and then we can go outside.','stop','begin','grow heavier'],['eager','Unlike his bored brother, Sam was eager to start the puzzle.','excited and ready','bored and slow','unable to start'],['feeble','The sick kitten was too feeble to climb the step.','weak','strong','playful'],['peculiar','The soup had a peculiar taste. No one could name the strange flavor.','odd or unusual','plain and common','very sweet'],['cluttered','The cluttered closet was so full of junk that the door would not close.','messy and crowded','empty and clean','locked and safe'],['reside','Owls often reside in hollow trees, where they live and raise their young.','live','hunt','fly'],['vivid','The vivid painting had bright reds and deep blues instead of pale colors.','bright and strong','pale and faint','old and torn'],['frigid','The frigid lake was so cold that ice formed at its edge.','extremely cold','pleasantly warm','very deep'],['gradual','The change was gradual; the puppy grew a little each week.','slow, step by step','sudden and quick','staying the same'],['mend','Grandma will mend the torn sock with a needle and thread.','repair','throw away','tear more']
].map(r=>rr(`What does ${r[0]} mean here?`,`여기서 ${r[0]}의 뜻을 골라요.`,...r.slice(1))),
