 ...qa('Keep both actions in the past.','두 행동이 모두 과거가 되도록 빈칸에 알맞은 낱말을 골라요.')([['Last summer, we went to the lake and __ in the cool water.','swam','swim','swimmed'],['Yesterday, Ella drew a map and __ it to her friend.','gave','give','gived'],['Last night, the dog barked and __ under the bed.','hid','hide','hided'],['On Monday, Jay wrote a letter and __ it to his aunt.','sent','send','sended']]),
